    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_PHOTO_001",
      "type": "photo",
      "text": "照片已经褪色。女孩看着镜头，而年轻的周叙没有看镜头，他在看她。",
      "next": "CH01_EP02_C001",
      "backText": "照片背面写着：2009.6，南门那棵树。周叙拍照的时候能不能看镜头。",
      "setFlags": [
        "VIEWED_OLD_PHOTO"
      ],
      "effects": {
        "nostalgia": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_LETTER_001",
      "type": "letter",
      "text": "信封正面写着“周叙 收”。右下角只有三个字：许知夏。",
      "next": "CH01_EP02_C001",
      "setFlags": [
        "VIEWED_LETTER"
      ],
      "actionText": "查看信封"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_MP3_001",
      "type": "photo",
      "text": "旧MP3屏幕全黑，按下电源没有任何反应。",
      "next": "CH01_EP02_C001",
      "setFlags": [
        "FOUND_MP3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_NAME_001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ANRAN",
      "text": "认识？",
      "next": "CH01_EP02_C002"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_C002",
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "高中同学。",
          "effects": {
            "honesty": 1,
            "avoidance": 2
          },
          "setFlags": [
            "ANSWERED_CLASSMATE"
          ],
          "next": "CH01_EP02_A001"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "以前喜欢过的人。",
          "effects": {
            "honesty": 5,
            "understandingPartner": 2
          },
          "setFlags": [
            "TOLD_PARTNER_XIA"
          ],
          "next": "CH01_EP02_B001"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "以前很熟的朋友。",
          "effects": {
            "nostalgia": 1,
            "avoidance": 2
          },
          "setFlags": [
            "CALLED_XIA_OLD_FRIEND"
          ],
          "next": "CH01_EP02_C001A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_A001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ANRAN",
      "text": "高中同学？还给你写过信。",
      "next": "CH01_EP02_END"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_B001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ANRAN",
      "text": "初恋？怪不得你刚才看见名字以后，半天没说话。",
      "next": "CH01_EP02_END"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP02_C001A",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ANRAN",
      "text": "能把信留到现在，应该确实挺熟的。",
      "next": "CH01_EP02_END"
    },
